Conclusion:

The previous PPViewHashesDontMatch failure on the Plutus spend/update branch was caused by older Mesh SDK transaction/cost-model handling. Upgrading @meshsdk/core from 1.9.0-beta.102 to 1.9.0-beta.103 caused the builder to fetch cost models during transaction build. Two consecutive updates using the same sensor asset name dht22_sensor_01 submitted and confirmed successfully.
